(The AeroVantage X9 utilizes dual 22,000 mAh 6S LiPo smart batteries monitored at) Tj
T*
(the individual cell level:) Tj
T*
(- Stage 1 Low Voltage Warning: 3.60 Volts per cell \(amber telemetry alert\).) Tj
