(- Stage 2 Forced Emergency Return-to-Home \(RTH\): Triggered automatically when any) Tj
T*
(cell drops to a minimum threshold of 3.45 Volts per cell.) Tj
T*
(- Stage 3 Critical Auto-Land: Triggered at 3.30 Volts per cell.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
( Operational Compliance Note \(Ref-3-29\): All personnel and automated auditing) Tj
